      },
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Cobra de Grama. A folha na cauda de Snivy gera energia quando recebe luz solar, deixando-o mais veloz e fortalecendo seus golpes. Ele prefere evitar grupos e usa as vinhas com habilidade para compensar seus braços curtos.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 1/2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo, Grama &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 88% M / 12% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/3</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Snivy pode evoluir para Servine no nível 6 ou superior. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Tackle</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Leer</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Vine Whip</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Wrap</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Growth</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Leaf Tornado, Magical Leaf</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Leech Seed</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Mega Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Slam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Leaf Blade</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Coil</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Giga Drain</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Wring Out</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Gastro Acid</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Leaf Storm</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>Aerial Ace, Aqua Tail, Attract, Bind, Bullet Seed, Calm Mind, Confide, Defog, Double Team, Double-Edge, Endure, Energy Ball, Facade, Frustration, Gastro Acid, Giga Drain, Grass Knot, Grass Pledge, Grassy Glide, Grassy Terrain, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Iron Tail, Knock Off, Leaf Storm, Light Screen, Magical Leaf, Nature Power, Petal Blizzard, Protect, Reflect, Rest, Return, Round, Safeguard, Seed Bomb, Sleep Talk, Snatch, Snore, Solar Beam, Substitute, Sunny Day, Swagger, Swift, Swords Dance, Synthesis, Take Down, Taunt, Tera Blast, Torment, Toxic, Trailblaze, Work Up, Worry Seed</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Captivate, Glare, Grassy Terrain, Iron Tail, Magical Leaf, Mean Look, Mirror Coat, Natural Gift, Pursuit, Sweet Scent, Synthesis, Twister</p>",
